    "id": "53350",
    "name": "Corned Beef and Cabbage – Jamaican Style",
    "cuisine": "Jamaican",
    "instructions": "Heat olive oil in a skillet or Dutch pot over medium-high heat. Add onion and green pepper and sauté for about 3-5 minutes.\r\nAdd garlic and stir for about 1 minute.\r\nAdd shredded cabbage and stir. Cook for about about 3-5 minutes, stirring often until softened.\r\nAdd corned beef, Roma tomatoes, and thyme and stir. Add ketchup and scotch bonnet pepper sauce and stir. Reduce heat and cook on medium for about 3-5 minutes, until the corned beef is heated through. Remove from heat.\r\nServe with white rice, bread, or on its own.",
